	"UUID": "657b43aa-250f-4524-ae1a-8d84dec57ee6",
	"Name": "Okta Investigation",
	"Description": "Work one actor, one target, and/or one source address across every Okta System Log event. Every tile takes the same three dashboard variables, so filling in any one of them pivots the whole page; the other two can be left as * .\n\nRead it top to bottom: the risk summary says whether there is anything worth reading, then successful and failed authentications say what was reached, then MFA and recovery activity says how, then configuration changes say what was left behind.\n\nThe Okta Actor, Okta Target, and Okta IP actionables jump straight here from any search result.",
